{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A wild little bear. A twisted lab. And a claw machine like no other.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3b<i>Bearly Escape</i> is a VR adventure where you rescue plushified animals, solve puzzles, and claw your way out of a bizarre underground facility where profit trumps ethics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/03_CapturedAtWake-up.gif?t=1750418603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf32Wake up deep in the forest as a confused little bear\u2014then run for your life as a massive mechanical claw hunts you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/01_BigClawLittleClaw.gif?t=1750418603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude81Enter the twisted world of claw machines, where small claws fail, but massive industrial claws grab anything\u2014if you\u2019ve got the guts (and timing).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/05_Puzzle.gif?t=1750418603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9Solve puzzles alongside your bear buddy and unlock the doors to a hidden laboratory filled with secrets, traps, and lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/02_Portal.gif?t=1750418603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6Leap through glowing portals to discover lush forests and surreal crane arenas that blend nature with sci-fi chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/04_Montage.gif?t=1750418603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaeUnlock epic bear powers\u2014double jumps, giant cannons, and a hammer big enough to smash cages and enemies alike.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hard - working little bee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596370/36052ab88f7a2c699e3035e66ff12b9aa4f5fc0f.jpg"},{"name":"Claw machine master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596370/cd884cf3eb3f3156f759c746204ca4aae984d5c8.jpg"},{"name":"Practice makes perfect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596370/903846e06ea43a09605ebe8e82ad23d7e40d31c3.jpg"},{"name":"Proof Of Strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596370/b633e98b72e4bba9815c7e20dd0dd81100f6c36e.jpg"},{"name":"Reach the Pinnacle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596370/a16a206431438c231ffa90ac1b29b33a6c6b8dd7.jpg"},{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596370/6bc7b218bcab249a1486773be6ef51fe9ac34f83.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596370/e7a2514549052f6b24e6dddedfe197447b1aa1ed.jpg"},{"name":"Wealthy and Wild","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596370/fa38543184cc43e9c15b1d9ba6cca6ea70999ebc.jpg"},{"name":"E-sports expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596370/80cfde9313f5d2bc778007245052792881d97839.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596370/30d15dcedae19a216f20d1f7f23b04263798a1ad.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3596370?t=1750418603","background_raw":"https://st